ChatMessage.description:
One inbound message. `content` is a plain string in this commit;
OpenAI also allows an array of content parts, which we reject for
now (see module docs).

status.description:
Row status. `pending` for classic creates (re-issuing a
challenge for an existing domain also resets it to `pending`);
`verified` for zone-backed creates, by construction.

id.description:
Tenant identifier. Stable across the tenant's lifetime;
embedded into API keys and audit log rows. Format is
`tnt_<base32-no-pad>`, ~28 chars.

path_prefix.description:
New path prefix. Must start with `/`. Changing this triggers
the same `(host, path_prefix)` uniqueness check as POST;
collision returns `409 route_conflict`.
